"jj describe -m \"feat: show the running version in the menu-bar menu; bump to 0.2.0\n\nThe ⌘⇥ menu now opens with a greyed-out \\\"WinDough 0.2.0\\\" row and a\nseparator above Quit, so a bug report can name the build. The row has no\naction and no target, which NSMenu's auto-enabling renders disabled.\n\nThe version lives once, in [workspace.package]; the three crates inherit\nit with version.workspace = true. The app passes CARGO_PKG_VERSION to\ninstall_status_item, and scripts/bundle.sh reads the same value through\ncargo pkgid for CFBundleShortVersionString instead of a hardcoded 0.1.0,\nso the menu, the manifests, and Info.plist cannot disagree.\" && jj new && jj log -r 'main::@' --no-graph -T 'change_id.short() ++ \" \" ++ description.first_line() ++ \"\\n\"'"
